  <h1>Marisa Vasconcelos</h1>
  <h3>Research Scientist in Responsible AI and Social Media</h3>
  <p>Ph.D. in Computer Science, bridging academia and industry with over 25 years of experience. Specialist in Responsible AI, ethics in technology, and social media analysis. I work on projects that combine rigorous research with practical innovation, across international contexts.</p>
